      "title": "单一赢家",
      "items": [
        "DynamicListView.dispatchTouchEvent 记录 mCurrentHandlingTouchEventHandler，一方 isInteracting 后向另一方发 ACTION_CANCEL",
        "手势结束（UP/CANCEL）清空该 handler，下一次按下重新竞争"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "拖拽落位",
      "items": [
